{
  "title": "105: Al-Fil الفيل",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This is a ‘Makki’ Surah with 5 verses. It is narrated from Imam Ja’far al-Sadiq (a.s.) that whoever recites this Surah in his obligatory prayers, the mountains will bear witness on the Day of Judgement that he prayed and he will be taken to Paradise on the command of Allah (s.w.t.).\nThe person who recites this Surah is kept safe from his enemies and has his difficulties and problems solved quickly. Recitation of this Surah is also helpful in remaining safe from evil tyrant rulers.\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِاَصْحٰبِ الْفِيْلِؕ‏(1)\nALAM TARA KAYFA FA-A’LA RABBOKA BE-ASHAABIL FEEL. \nHave you not considered how your Lord dealt with the possessors of the elephant? \nاَلَمْ يَجْعَلْ كَيْدَهُمْ فِىْ تَضْلِيْلٍۙ‏(2)\nALAM YAJ-A’L KAYDAHUM FEE TAZLEELINW. \nDid He not cause their war to end in confusion, \nوَّاَرْسَلَ عَلَيْهِمْ طَيْرًا اَبَابِيْلَۙ‏(3)\nWA ARSALA A’LAYHIM TAYRAN ABAABEELA. \nAnd send down (to prey) upon them birds in flocks, \nتَرْمِيْهِمْ بِحِجَارَةٍ مِّنْ سِجِّيْلٍۙ‏(4)\nTARMEEHIM BE-HEJAARATIM MIN SIJJEELIN. \nCasting against them stones of baked clay, \nفَجَعَلَهُمْ كَعَصْفٍ مَّاْكُوْلٍ‏(5)\nFA-JA-A’LAHUM KA-A’SFIM MAAKOOL.\nSo He rendered them like straw eaten up? "
}
